  accTitle: Current finite campaign custody and cleanup
  accDescr: Actual process ownership. One campaign custodian owns the exact native target group and computer runtime and delegates Pi and MCP group cleanup to the driver. Native inherits the shared lock for its lifetime. Cancellation permanently stops input and closes only owned groups. Normal exit before forced signals, process absence and save claims are distinct.
