  C -->|"Exact native handle and inherited lock/socket"| N["Owned native process group<br/>Windowed target and SDL adapter"]
  C --> R["Computer runtime and loopback server<br/>One writer and original store"]
  C --> D["Campaign driver<br/>Aggregate original attempts and host time"]
  D -->|"Exact owned host/MCP groups"| P["Original Pi actor<br/>At most one verified successor"]
  X["Pause, cancellation, deadline or failure"] -->|"Permanent stop then owned cleanup"| C
  D -->|"Host quiescence and attempt receipts"| C
  N -->|"Exit sampled before forced signals<br/>Absence reported separately"| C
  C --> E["campaign-receipt/2<br/>No game acceptance or save certification"]
